title: "DCFNet-DS: exact polynomial-degree decomposition for network intrusion detection"
abstract: "Model, preprocessing, training and analysis code reproducing every table and figure of the paper. Version 2.0.0 adds the resubmission package in dcfnet-ds2-1/ (new partitions, ten-seed training, capacity controls, three-level exactness checks, margin attribution, frontier baselines)."
